This PR allows to export `impl`s that have lifetime annotations (to fix #131) like the one below:

```
struct Person<'a> {
    pub name: &'a String,
}

#[extendr]
impl<'a> Person<'a> {
    fn new() -> Self {
        Self { name: &"".to_string() }
    }
}
```

